<section id="about" class="section about">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="section__label">About</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">From field ecology to trusted analytics</h2>
      <p class="about__copy">
        Matthew Whittle is a hands-on data scientist and technical lead based in West Yorkshire. He
        started in ecological survey and assessment, then moved into applied geospatial machine
        learning and software — at Jacobs, founding and growing a coding community while shipping
        modelling and routing work; at SLR, building habitat-mapping and API products while coaching
        geospatial developers toward collaborative cloud engineering.
      </p>
      <p class="about__copy about__copy--spaced">
        Since early 2026 he has led SLR’s internal Data Warehouse &amp; Analytics function on an
        interim basis, spanning Fabric foundations, reporting, and forecasting experiments — while
        staying technically involved. This site is a quiet, interactive CV: selected work, honest
        boundaries, room to grow.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="contact" class="contact reveal" data-delay="2">
      <p class="section__label">Contact</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">Say hello</h2>
      <p class="about__copy">
        Best reached by email or LinkedIn. GitHub holds open-source experiments like
        <a href="https://github.com/MatthewJWhittle/tilearray">tilearray</a>.
      </p>
      <ul class="contact__list">
        <li>
          <a href="mailto:matthewjwhittle@gmail.com">matthewjwhittle@gmail.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/matthewjwhittle/">LinkedIn</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/MatthewJWhittle">GitHub</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap site-footer__inner">
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Matthew Whittle</p>
    <p class="site-footer__meta">Astro · React islands · natural stylized</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .about__copy {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 38rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .about__copy--spaced {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .contact__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .contact__list a {
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .contact__list a:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-block: var(--space-4);
  }

  .site-footer__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.85fr;
      gap: var(--space-6);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
</style>
